 good things without ignoring what is difficult.","I have the strength to make difficult decisions.","I trust the journey I am on, even when things feel difficult.","I can hold on to hope even when life feels difficult.","I choose hope because my future is worth believing in.","I learn from challenges without judging myself.","I can find a useful next step in difficult situations.","I forgive myself and others for past pain.","I welcome opportunities, learn from setbacks, and keep moving forward.","I am allowed to have difficult days.","I am supported even when things feel difficult.","I can break difficult tasks into smaller steps.","I will keep believing that better moments are possible.","My inner strength is greater than my struggles.","I trust that new opportunities can come from difficult experiences.","I can rely on myself during both good and difficult times.","I am not defined by difficult moments.","I am gentle with myself during difficult moments.","I can accept what happened without being harsh with myself."]},{"title":"Growth","lines":["I keep going even when progress feels slow.","I am willing to learn what I need to create a better life.","I continue to grow with kindness and patience.","I approach learning with curiosity and excitement.","I treat mistakes as information I can learn from.","I release any regrets and focus on the lessons I have learned.","I have strengths that I can continue to develop.","I am committed to my growth, not perfection.","I grow with others, not alone.","I track my progress and adjust when needed.","My life gets better because my thinking gets better.","I know that progress happens one step at a time.","I improve my habits step by step.","I am allowed to grow beyond old limits.","I am growing more aware of my thoughts.","I am ready to make the changes I need to grow and move forward.","I recognize my strengths without ignoring the things I need to learn.","I accept who I am while giving myself room to grow.","I am patient 