th and courage guide me through tough times.","I have the courage to follow my heart.","I can choose courage over self-doubt.","I approach my work with curiosity and courage.","I have the courage to face uncomfortable situations.","My opinions matter, and I express them clearly and boldly.","I am proud of myself for having the courage to begin again.","I face the day with courage.","I am brave, even when things are tough.","I keep moving forward with courage.","I trust myself to step forward with courage.","I am guided by my courage to make decisions aligned with my values.","I take bold action and trust my instincts.","I choose courage even when I feel afraid.","I speak my mind with courage and conviction.","My purpose gives me courage and confidence.","I protect my energy, believe in myself, and move forward with courage.","I am not afraid to stand up for myself and my dreams.","I have shown up with courage and heart.","I let my bravery shape the life I’m building.","I am brave enough to speak up.","I speak my truth with kindness and courage.","I am committed to making decisions with clarity and courage.","I honor my courage to move forward.","My dreams are valid, and I pursue them boldly.","I am my own source of strength, wisdom, and courage.","I make bold choices that align with my vision.","I step forward with courage even when I feel unsure.","I choose honesty, even when it takes courage.","I accept change with patience and courage.","I celebrate the courage it takes to try something new.","I am defined by my courage to keep going.","I am moving forward—wiser, braver, and more grounded in who I am.","My heart is open, and my spirit is bold.","I allow myself to take bold steps with trust.","I welcome new beginnings with courage and excitement.","I release hesitation and trust that I am capable of taking bold steps.","My courage grows with every step I take forward.","I am brave enough to let go of what no longer serves me.","I celebrate courage, even in small everyday ways.","My heart is brave, and my spirit is strong.","My boldness brings me closer to my goals.","I trust my courage to see me through.","I celebrate the courage I showed in uncertain moments.","I choose boldness over fear.","I boldly go after the things that bring me joy.","My courage empowers me to be authentic.","I do not silence my ideas—I explore them with curiosity and courage.","I embrace the unknown with courage and curiosity.","I can face an uncertain future with courage and patience.","I boldly step outside my comfort zone and embrace growth.","I am bold and unafraid to be seen.","I act with courage, even when it is hard.","I walk my path with courage and compassion.","I am open to new experiences with courage.","I embrace discomfort, for it is where courage thrives.","My courage is stronger than my doubts.","I am courageous, and I stand up for what I believe in.","I replace hesitation with boldness.","I act with bravery even in uncertainty.","I do hard things with courage and care.","I approach decisions with an open mind and a courageous heart.","I courageously take the next step.","I carry courage in my heart.","I believe in my dreams and have the courage to pursue them.","I choose courage, even when the path is unclear.","I honor my truth and live it courageously.","I take action with courage and consistency.","I embody courage in my actions—not just in my thoughts.","I am courageously following my own path in life.","I wake each day with hope and courage."]},{"title":"Contentment","lines":["I accept the things I cannot change, and I live in peace with them.","My life makes me smile.","I feel deeply fulfilled because I listen to my heart.","My life inspires me.","I am happy with myself the way that I am.","I have earned this peace.","I allow myself to enjoy simple pleasures.","Every day, I am becoming happier and more content.","My whole life is a big adventure, and I am a curious adventurer.","I feel fine, safe and secure.","I have reasons to 